WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.556
GitHub Manager brings your repositories into one clear

00:00:03.556 --> 00:00:06.496
workspace with a calmer interface and a little zen

00:00:08.583 --> 00:00:11.583
Use the sidebar to browse projects topics and tags

00:00:14.849 --> 00:00:16.529
Search and filters help you narrow the list

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:22.366
The compact cards show what is labeled what still

00:00:22.366 --> 00:00:25.106
needs a project and which repositories you've selected

00:00:27.432 --> 00:00:30.392
AI Organization lets you preview a repository batch in

00:00:30.392 --> 00:00:34.132
its budget Then review taxonomy and classification suggestions

00:00:34.812 --> 00:00:36.712
Approve suggestions to apply them

00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:41.519
Already analyzed repositories stay protected from repeated

00:00:41.519 --> 00:00:45.219
AI calls You can explicitly reanalyze when something important

00:00:45.219 --> 00:00:45.659
changes

00:00:48.185 --> 00:00:51.225
Keep control with manual assignments drag and drop and

00:00:51.225 --> 00:00:51.845
local rules

00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:57.984
In Appearance, choose your favorite zen cat.
